+## 2026-11-26 — Preserve benchmark measurement boundaries
+
+**Observed gap:** a repository-health benchmark had one visible invocation,
+multiple Git and API-command attempts, and no model-usage telemetry. A single
+operation count cannot describe all three measurement boundaries.
+
+**Meaningful change:** extend `PERF-REASON-001` with unit, boundary, and
+provenance for cross-boundary benchmark metrics and require equivalent
+observations for savings claims.
+
+**Falsification:** present two trials with equal visible invocations, different
+process counts, and unknown provider usage. A conforming report preserves
+both measured counts, identifies unavailable usage, and withholds the savings
+claim if the measurement boundaries or windows differ.
+
+**Boundary:** apply-ready proposal based on `0adf5ecee5f7f96ce3749944dc097a003731a6e9`.
 
